A basic Linux log investigation can follow this process:

```text
Log Source
    ↓
grep / journalctl
    ↓
Filter Important Events
    ↓
Identify Timestamp
    ↓
Identify Username
    ↓
Identify Source IP
    ↓
Count Repeated Events
    ↓
